        <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E7E8EC;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px;margin-bottom:24px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#374151">This is a complete reference to India’s accounting standards — the <strong style="color:#1B365D">AS</strong> applied by entities outside the Ind AS regime and the <strong style="color:#1B365D">Ind AS</strong> notified under the Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Rules. Browse the full list below; each standard links to a detailed guide on scope, applicability and disclosures.</p></div>
